Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.76,0:00:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,准备直播 四 三…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And we're on in four, three,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.96,0:00:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,二 一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}two, one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.04,0:01:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我说全美治安最差的城市{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What if I told you that even the worst neighborhood in America{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.88,0:01:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,都能整顿到安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}could be made completely safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.16,0:01:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我说这能成真{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what if I told you that this could be accomplished{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.16,0:01:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,而且不危及任何一个警察的生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}without risking the life of one single law enforcement officer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.48,0:01:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么敢打包票？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How do I know this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.00,0:01:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,因为现在全世界每个国家都在改变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because it's happening right now in every country in the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.68,0:01:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,只有美国除外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.04,0:01:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我是派特诺维克 欢迎收看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm Pat Novak, and welcome to The Novak Element.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.20,0:01:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚的关键时刻环节{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In tonight's State of the Union segment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.84,0:01:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们请来孟罗将军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we'll be joined by General Curtis Monroe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.96,0:01:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,在国防部战情室和我们现场连线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}live from the War Room in the Pentagon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,孟罗将军 欢迎回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}General Monroe, welcome back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 派特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good to see you, Pat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢军方破天荒让我们参与行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you for this unprecedented access to your operations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.52,0:01:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,请告诉我们现在的情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Could you walk us through what we're seeing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.32,0:01:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这是例行行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, this is a routine operation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.64,0:01:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们发现随机巡逻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We found that random patrols{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.88,0:01:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,有助于当地居民对我们的信任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}helped the local population to feel safer and to trust us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.32,0:01:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不可思议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:02:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,将军 这些颜色代表什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what are these colored dots that we're seeing here, General?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.48,0:02:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们在当地的资产{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These are our assets on the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.52,0:02:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,绿色是ED-209{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In green, we got the ED-209s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.16,0:02:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,负责周边安全的大型机器人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're the big boys. They secure the perimeter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.04,0:02:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,紫色是比较小的EM-208{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Purple are the smaller E M-208s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.28,0:02:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他们负责检查{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They sweep and mop up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.00,0:02:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,派特 红色是你们的记者团队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the red dots, Pat, that's your film crew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.64,0:02:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴看见美国制造的机器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is great to see American machines{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.20,0:02:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,在海外促进和平与自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}helping to promote peace and freedom abroad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.56,0:02:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 这是例行行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, you guys, this is a standard op, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.40,0:02:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不会有冲突发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's no opposition expected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这样机器会视你们的安全为优先{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All our drones are gonna give top priority to your safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.00,0:02:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,从来没有红色资产被杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No red assets have ever been lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.20,0:02:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吗？- 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Okay? - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.40,0:02:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你有比较放心吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does that make you feel better?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.04,0:02:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 听着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But, listen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.84,0:02:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,只要戴着手环就不会有事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}keep those bracelets on, you're completely safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.68,0:02:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.84,0:02:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,该上场了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good. Enjoy the show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.00,0:02:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.36,0:03:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,愿和平与你同在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May peace be upon you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.04,0:03:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,请走出房屋 举起双手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please exit your homes with your arms raised{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.36,0:03:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,接受扫描检查{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for a noninvasive scanning procedure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.92,0:03:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人会受伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No one will be harmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.12,0:03:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,请走出房屋 举起双手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please exit your homes with your arms raised{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.64,0:03:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,接受一种无害的扫描{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for a noninvasive scanning procedure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.80,0:03:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人会受伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No one will be harmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.12,0:03:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,史考特 拍这边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Scott, get me a shot of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.48,0:03:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢您的合作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your cooperation is appreciated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.60,0:03:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉造成不便{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We apologize for any inconvenience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.72,0:03:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,愿和平与你同在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May peace be upon you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.44,0:03:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不可思议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Incredible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.00,0:03:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,真是不可思议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Incredible!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.08,0:03:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不久前这任务是由美国士兵…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not long ago, that would have been American men and women{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.40,0:04:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,冒着生命危险在进行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}risking their lives to pacify these people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.64,0:04:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,将军 你的看法如何？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}General, you care to comment on this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.96,0:04:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 派特 越南 伊拉克 阿富汗的悲剧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, Pat, we had Vietnam, we had Iraq, we had Afghanistan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.84,0:04:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,决不会再发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.12,0:04:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这是军方无价的资产{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From a military perspective, this has been invaluable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.76,0:04:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不用再牺牲美国人的生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We can accomplish our objectives without any loss to American lives{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.68,0:04:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我想那里的好人也会衷心感谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I think the honest people over there really appreciate it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.40,0:04:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这是当然的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And why wouldn't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.00,0:04:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人有生以来第一次 能看见他们的小孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For the first time in their lives they get to watch their children grow up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.84,0:04:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,在安全无虞的环境中长大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in an environment of safety and security.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.28,0:04:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,纳维{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Navid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.76,0:04:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不要站在窗户边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get away from the window!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.52,0:04:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,妈 它们来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mom! They're here! They're coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.60,0:04:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,快过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come here! Come here right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.80,0:04:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,阿拉西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Arash!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.60,0:04:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,纳维 保护你妈和妹妹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Navid! You stay with your mom and sisters!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.56,0:04:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他只是个孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But he's just a kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.28,0:04:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,莎耶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sayeh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.24,0:04:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,和你妈和妹妹待在家里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay here with your mom and the kids!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.32,0:04:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在干什么？- 照我说的做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What do you think you're doing? - You heard me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.16,0:04:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,阿拉西 拜托别这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Arash, please don't go! Don't do this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.64,0:04:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,纳维 快过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Navid! My dear! Come back here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.48,0:05:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,纳维{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Navid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.72,0:05:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,把门关上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shut the door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.96,0:05:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是要干掉它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're not here to kill any of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.48,0:05:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Got it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.56,0:05:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,重点是我们在电视上被杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The goal is to die on television.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.80,0:05:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.56,0:05:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,凯莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kelly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.68,0:05:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你听得见吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can you hear me out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.48,0:05:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,很清楚 派特 记者现在在德黑兰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Loud and clear, Pat. I'm here in sunny Tehran{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.40,0:05:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,当地居民显然乐意接受例行扫描{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}where locals have clearly embraced these routine scans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.72,0:05:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以看见这些居民都很合作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you can see behind me, they're working in collaboration with the robots{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.68,0:05:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,显然维护居民的安全是首要任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and obviously their safety is everyone's top priority.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.04,0:05:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我下令前不要动作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't make a move before I say...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.04,0:05:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我要确定他们有在拍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wanna make sure they're recording.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.40,0:05:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.16,0:05:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes! Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.28,0:05:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.44,0:06:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你得告诉儿童{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'll notice children{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.60,0:06:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,街上那些儿童 这真是…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the streets as well. This is everyday life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,和平美好的一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}happening in perfect harmony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.08,0:06:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 这 来这{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, great. Here, come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.44,0:06:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不要动 不要动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay put, stay put, stay put.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.76,0:06:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 机器人会处理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's fine. Don't worry. My guy's got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.56,0:06:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,纳维 窗户边很危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Navid! It's dangerous here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.64,0:06:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come away! Come...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.64,0:06:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Navid, where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.44,0:06:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我 纳维{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look at me! Navid! Navid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.84,0:06:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你在找什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you looking for? Navid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.32,0:06:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,纳维 你在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Navid! Navid! What are you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.36,0:06:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,纳维 别去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Navid! Don't go! Navid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.96,0:07:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.08,0:07:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,放下武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Drop your weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.64,0:07:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,凯莉？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kelly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.84,0:07:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,凯莉 你还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kelly! Are you all right? Kelly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.92,0:07:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没事 派特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're okay, Pat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,机器人刚击毙炸弹客{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our robots have just repelled some suicide bombers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.96,0:07:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 凯莉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sorry, Kelly,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.40,0:07:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,基于安全理由国防部要切断讯号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but for security reasons the Pentagon's going to cut our feed to Tehran.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.28,0:07:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,请多加小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But, please, be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.64,0:07:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我会持续待命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah. I'll continue to stand by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.88,0:07:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,各位看见机器人在海外的重要性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now you see how fundamental these robots are to our foreign policy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.12,0:07:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我不禁要问{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So then tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.52,0:07:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么美国不能使用这些机器？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why can't we use these machines here at home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.16,0:07:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么美国这么怕机器？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why is America so robophobic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.88,0:07:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,一边我们请到雷蒙赛勒斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On the one hand, we have Raymond Sellars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.80,0:07:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他是企业家和真正的爱国者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An entrepreneur and true American{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.04,0:07:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他的产品刚救了我同事的命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}whose product just saved my colleague's life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.52,0:08:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,另外一边请到的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And on the other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,修伯崔佛斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hubert Dreyfus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.20,0:08:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,紧抓过去不肯前进的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man with both feet planted firmly in the past{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.48,0:08:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他的法案禁止在美国使用机器人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}whose bill prohibits the use of drones on US soil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.88,0:08:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,美国人支持崔佛斯法案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The American people support the Dreyfus Act{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.08,0:08:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为他们没见识过这种科技{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}because they haven't experienced this technology{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.72,0:08:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,人们对不了解的事感到害怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and they fear what they don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.36,0:08:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,本节目支持赛勒斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We at The Novak Element support Mr. Sellars' efforts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.08,0:08:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他努力想让我们的国家更安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to make our country and our viewers safer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.36,0:08:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After all,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.36,0:08:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么比美国人的安全更重要？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what's more important than the safety of the American people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.64,0:09:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 墨菲 - 嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Hey, Murphy. - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.48,0:09:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How's Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.28,0:09:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,还不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We don't know yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.24,0:09:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 墨菲 - 嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Hey. - Murphy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.12,0:09:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还好吗？- 还好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- How's it going? - Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.72,0:09:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在这里干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What the hell are they doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.12,0:09:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,六死 路易斯受伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Six in the morgue. Lewis in the hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.12,0:09:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你闯下大祸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This was the mother of all bad ideas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.12,0:09:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们追到安东尼范伦的线索{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We got a lead on Antoine Vallon, we took it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.16,0:09:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,什么线索？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What lead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.12,0:09:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不要在他们面前说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not in front of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.92,0:09:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 胡扯 - 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- This is bullshit. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.00,0:09:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你对我们有意见？墨菲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, you got something to say, Murphy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.68,0:09:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,范伦是我们的案子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vallon's our case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.84,0:09:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,两年啥都没有？你们不是笨就是有鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, two years without no arrest, no nothing? You've gotta be dumb or dirty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.68,0:09:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你有证据？还是看我们不顺眼？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You got something on us? Or is this personal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.28,0:09:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这无关私人恩怨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, it's nothing personal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.60,0:09:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我是看你不顺眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Although, I don't like you as a person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.68,0:09:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 你们俩出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, you two, out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.68,0:09:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.52,0:09:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe if you hadn't gone off the reservation,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.00,0:09:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他现在还活跳跳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your partner would still be standing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.68,0:09:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说什么？- 够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What'd you say to me? - Hey, that's enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.64,0:10:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.64,0:10:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,现在只有我们俩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's just you and me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.20,0:10:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我和杰克去买赃物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So me and Jack, we've been doin' some street buys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.68,0:10:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们发现一些枪的线索{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We get a line on some guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.96,0:10:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们和一个小混混杰瑞碰面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We meet up with this low-level G called Jerry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.04,0:10:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他手里竟然有高级军火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who ends up havin' a piece he's not supposed to have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.68,0:10:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么有这种枪 杰瑞？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where the hell you get a gun like that, Jerry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.64,0:10:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以给你两大箱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can get you two whole crates full, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.64,0:10:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,两箱？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two crates?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.80,0:10:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你这小咖哪来这么多枪？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No disrespect, J, but how a clown like you get so much product, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.88,0:10:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,关你屁事？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's it matter where it comes from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.20,0:10:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,当然有关 我们不要赃货{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why it matters, we don't want no dirty guns, Jerry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.96,0:10:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这些枪杀过人吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These guns got bodies on 'em, Jerry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.88,0:10:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这是干净的 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yo, look, they're clean, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.12,0:10:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你们到底买不买？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You gonna buy this shit or not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.68,0:10:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你干嘛这么紧张？你有鬼？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why you acting so nervous, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.24,0:10:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你在钓我们？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You fishin' on us, Jerry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.16,0:10:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What'd you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.36,0:10:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你觉得他有鬼？- 我觉得他在钓我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You think he fishin', D? - I think he's fishin' on us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.40,0:10:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在说什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yo, what the hell are they talkin' about, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.88,0:10:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你电话给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, let me see your phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.72,0:10:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,给我看你的电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me see your phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.80,0:10:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不要给你我的电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not showing you my phone, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.12,0:10:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你在录音？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You recordin' this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.64,0:10:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈的是条子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think you're a goddamn cop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.20,0:10:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你在胡说什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What the hell are you talkin' about, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.28,0:10:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不给你电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not showing you my phone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.68,0:10:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,把枪放下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey! Put your gun down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.84,0:10:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你电话拿来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Put your phones on the table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.12,0:10:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是警察 我们替范伦工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're not cops, all right? We work for Antoine Vallon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.24,0:11:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.40,0:11:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 你刚说什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shut up! Shut up! What'd you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.56,0:11:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,原来他替范伦工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ends up he works for Vallon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.52,0:11:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,在碰面前我们查了枪枝编号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Before the meet, we ran the serial numbers on the rifles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.52,0:11:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这些枪应该在警局的证物室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The guns were supposed to be in our evidence room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.92,0:11:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不是外头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not out on the street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.60,0:11:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,证物单是空白的 没有签名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Intake papers blank. No signatures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.84,0:11:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么样？- 都是空的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What do you got? - Nothin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.92,0:11:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么会这样？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How do you think that happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.68,0:11:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,墨菲 我们不该这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm telling you, Murphy, this is a mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.84,0:11:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人杀人不眨眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These guys'll shoot you just to see if they gun work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.20,0:11:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要支援{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We need backup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那样会有人给他通风报信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If we call for backup, word's gonna get around the station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.76,0:11:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他会逃跑的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's gonna disappear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.44,0:11:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's gonna be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.76,0:11:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们告诉范伦我们要买枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So we told Vallon we were gun buyers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.20,0:11:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他相信了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and he bought it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.52,0:11:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,为何要那么多枪？你们想造反？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you two need with that much product? You plotting a coup?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.44,0:11:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 不是用来对付你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Man, don't trip, we ain't gonna bust a single shot in your town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.96,0:11:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们跟芝加哥警局有帐要算{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We got some problems back home with Chicago PD.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.28,0:11:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说你不喜欢警察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, I heard you don't like cops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.60,0:11:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,老大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.48,0:11:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you got for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.76,0:11:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,真的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.96,0:12:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,就在快成交时 有人通知他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We were just about to close the deal but someone tipped him off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.80,0:12:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须接这通电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gentlemen, I gotta deal with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.40,0:12:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,两分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.88,0:12:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,把两个都杀了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make sure you kill 'em both!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.28,0:12:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,两支手枪 一支自动步枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I got two handguns, one automatic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.76,0:12:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得出去 我来对付自动步枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We gotta get out of here. I'm gonna take the automatic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.16,0:12:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You sure about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.84,0:13:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.68,0:13:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,路易斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lewis!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.76,0:13:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,路易斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lewis!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.76,0:13:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,警员中枪 汉米顿街331号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Officer down! Officer down, 331 Hamilton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.60,0:14:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯墨菲警探请求医疗支援{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is Detective Alex Murphy in need of immediate medical assistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.20,0:14:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,汉米顿街331号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}331 Hamilton Road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.20,0:14:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.28,0:14:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克 听得见吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jack, come on. Jack. Can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.76,0:14:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克 撑着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jack. Stay with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.68,0:14:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.36,0:14:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 你不能擅自行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex, you don't do something like this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.76,0:14:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须先来找我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}unless you bring it to me first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.60,0:14:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,范伦的交游广阔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vallon's connected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.12,0:14:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我警告你 不要再自作主张{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm warning you, don't make any more moves until I vet this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.08,0:14:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,有内贼偷枪给他…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If officers are supplying him with guns...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.88,0:14:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,交给风纪委员会调查{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's up to IAD.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.40,0:14:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我会处理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll handle it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.60,0:14:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,赛勒斯先生 不管机器人多精良{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't care how sophisticated these machines are, Mr. Sellars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,机器无法像人类一样有感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A machine does not know what it feels like to be human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.12,0:14:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,它不能了解人类生命的价值{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It can't understand the value of human life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.60,0:14:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们怎能允许它取人性命？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why should it be allowed to take one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.32,0:14:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这种攸关生死的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To legislate over life and death,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.76,0:14:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,应该交给能分辨对错的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we need people who understand right from wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.88,0:15:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你的机器人有什么感觉？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do your machines feel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.16,0:15:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不会感到愤怒 不会有歧视{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, they feel no anger. They feel no prejudice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.76,0:15:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,也不会疲倦 所以非常适合执法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They feel no fatigue, which makes them ideal for law enforcement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.32,0:15:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,让这些机器人到街上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Putting these machines on the streets{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.68,0:15:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,能拯救无数美国人的生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will save countless American lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.84,0:15:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在回避问题 - 我没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You're evading the question. - No, I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.84,0:15:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你有 你在回避问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, you're evading the question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.96,0:15:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我问你机器有什么感觉？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I asked what do these machines feel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.60,0:15:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,要是它们杀了小孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If one of them killed a child,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.52,0:15:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,它有什么感觉？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what would it feel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.60,0:15:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没感觉 - 这就是问题所在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Nothing. - And that's the problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.64,0:15:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,所以72%的美国人反对机器执法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's why 72% of Americans will not stand for a robot pulling the trigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.76,0:15:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,全世界最大的市场我们不能碰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}America is the world's most valuable market, and we can't touch it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.20,0:15:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,跨足美国市场每年能赚进六千亿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With a domestic expansion, we'd clear $600 billion per annum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.68,0:16:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,换句话说只要那法案存在的一天 我们就在失血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In other words, every second that law is in existence, we are hemorrhaging money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.72,0:16:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你要我怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you want me to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.88,0:16:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们捐钱给两党 但没人买帐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We've thrown cash at senators at both sides of the aisle. Nobody's budging.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.40,0:16:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不想惹恼选民{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They don't want to vote against their constituents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.48,0:16:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,除非说服民众 否则没有胜算{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So unless we sway public opinion, the battle's lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.68,0:16:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,为了达成这个目的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, to that effect,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.80,0:16:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我的团队想出积极的行销策略{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}my team have come up with a pretty aggressive new campaign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.24,0:16:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,吸睛指数破表{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wow factor off-the-charts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.88,0:16:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,美国人要的是他们能爱上的产品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We need to give Americans a product they can love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.08,0:16:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,一个真正的英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A figure they can rally behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.92,0:16:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我研究过 这法案没有漏洞可钻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir, I have dissected this bill. There are no loopholes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.08,0:16:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不能就这样把机器摆上街头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We can't put a machine on the streets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.84,0:16:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,别管机器了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forget machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你们看到民调结果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You saw the polls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.04,0:16:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,美国人不要机器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Americans don't want a machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.48,0:16:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要的是能分辨善恶的产品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They want a product with a conscience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.56,0:16:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要的是…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They want something that knows{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.52,0:16:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,像人类一样有感情的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what it feels like to be human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:17:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要把人放进机器里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're gonna put a man inside a machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.24,0:17:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是你的脚 手臂或手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're not you because of your legs, your arms, your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.16,0:17:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你的脑才是关键{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're you because of your brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.92,0:17:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你的脑处理资讯 让你成为你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's your brain's capacity to process information that makes you who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.72,0:17:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,放轻松 像平常一样就好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Relax, and just do what you've always done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.76,0:17:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我没用这个弹过吉他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've never played with these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.80,0:17:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,音乐不是来自手指 而是你的心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The music doesn't come from your fingers, Michael, it comes from your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.24,0:17:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,只要让音乐自然流露{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All you have to do is let it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.16,0:17:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,请{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.16,0:18:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.96,0:18:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 放轻松{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, it's okay. Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.68,0:18:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他很激动 资讯传递受阻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His emotions are peaking. The readings are getting clouded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.64,0:18:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.28,0:18:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,放轻松 太激动会影响脑化学{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Relax. If you get too emotional, it'll change the chemistry in your brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.76,0:18:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,使系统故障{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It'll throw the system out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.60,0:18:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你做得很好 加油{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're doing great. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.80,0:18:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要情绪才能演奏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need emotion to play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.56,0:18:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,阿兰奎斯协奏曲 第二乐章{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Concierto de Aranjuez, second movement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.04,0:18:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,太动人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Beautiful piece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.64,0:18:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,丹尼 我需要和你谈 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dennett, when you have a moment. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.68,0:19:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,雷蒙 你早就答应过我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, we agreed on this a long time ago, Raymond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.76,0:19:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不会要我发展武器应用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wouldn't be asked to develop combat applications.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.64,0:19:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我的工作纯粹为了科学进展{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My work here is driven by its own questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.88,0:19:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你的工作很了不起 但应用太少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And your work is brilliant. But your ideas are being underutilized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.52,0:19:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我想到一个办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, I think I found a way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.36,0:19:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不但能获利支持你的研究{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to put real revenue stream behind your research{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.80,0:19:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,也能拯救上千万人的性命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and save thousands of lives in the process.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.72,0:19:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你们没尽责 差点害我被抓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're not keeping up your end, leaving me exposed like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.68,0:19:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,墨菲警探只是太冲动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Detective Murphy's just a little impulsive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.64,0:19:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那就收买他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So put him on the payroll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.80,0:19:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么问题？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why are we talkin' about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.96,0:19:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会收 现在他搭档又受伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It won't work. And now that his partner got hit,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.60,0:19:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他绝对不会放任不管{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he's never gonna let it go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.68,0:19:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么？- 路易斯住的医院{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What is that? - Lewis' hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.72,0:19:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯下午会去 也许你想送花{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex is dropping by this afternoon, in case you want to send flowers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.48,0:19:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.{\r}
