Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.52,0:28:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.24,0:28:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.40,0:28:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你经历一场爆炸 艾力克斯 你现在在医院{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were in an explosion, Alex. You're in a hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.32,0:28:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱拉呢？我老婆 她在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where's Clara? My wife. Where's my wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.00,0:28:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你冷静下来 听我说 艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want you to calm down, Alex. Listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.52,0:28:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事 你家人也都没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're okay. And your family's fine. Both your wife and your son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.96,0:28:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who the hell are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.80,0:28:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我是丹尼诺顿博士 负责治疗你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm Dr. Dennett Norton. I'm treating you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.12,0:28:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,心跳加速{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Heart rate rising.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.04,0:28:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.04,0:28:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能动 这是什么鬼东西？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't move. What the hell is all that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.76,0:28:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,视力输入不稳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Visual input unstable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.08,0:28:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你放轻松 艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want you to relax, Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.56,0:28:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,对象肾上腺素过高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Subject's dumping too much epinephrine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.04,0:28:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要清除吗？- 还不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Should we purge it? - Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.04,0:29:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,释放脊椎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unlock vertebrae.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.04,0:29:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,继续{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go ahead, Kim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.96,0:29:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,释放上肢 下肢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unlock upper, lower extremities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.64,0:29:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么装备？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What kind of suit is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.88,0:29:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是装备 艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's not a suit, Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.52,0:29:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.68,0:29:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这是唯一的选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This was the only option.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.52,0:29:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在这里是为了让你重生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're here, all of us, to make you whole again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.64,0:29:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,释放全身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Full body unlock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.08,0:29:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,现在走路 艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want you to walk now, Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.52,0:29:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你做得到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.88,0:30:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉好真实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This seems so real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.56,0:30:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 你必须了解发生什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex, it's very important you understand what is happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.28,0:30:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.64,0:30:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不是梦 药物或麻醉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's not a dream, it's not drugs or anesthetics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.00,0:30:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我是在作梦 我感觉得到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know I'm dreaming 'cause I can feel all of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.92,0:30:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 截肢的人感觉得到截掉的肢体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex, amputees can often feel their missing appendages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.12,0:30:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这叫幻肢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's called phantom limb sensation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.40,0:30:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,什么"截肢的人"？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you mean "amputees"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.12,0:30:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你对我做了什么？- 你放轻松{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What the hell did you do to me? - You need to relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.16,0:30:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,把这衣服拿掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take this off me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.64,0:30:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我要脱掉这东西 你做了什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need to get out of this thing. What did you do to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.48,0:30:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你对我做了什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What have you done to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.84,0:30:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯？嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex? Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.08,0:30:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,关掉他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shut him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.28,0:30:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不 让他跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No! Let him run! Let him run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.44,0:31:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.24,0:31:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 拜托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.40,0:31:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,停下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.52,0:31:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 你必须停下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex, you have to stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.76,0:31:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.12,0:31:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.80,0:31:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,请停下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.76,0:31:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,站在那里 我们会去接你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay where you are and we'll come and pick you up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.72,0:32:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 金{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, Kim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.44,0:32:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,关掉他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shut him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.72,0:32:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.92,0:33:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你逃不掉的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you can't run from this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.76,0:33:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须了解现实状况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have to understand the reality of the situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.56,0:33:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,给我看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Show me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.96,0:33:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,金{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.20,0:33:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,噢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.80,0:33:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.12,0:33:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holy Christ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.60,0:33:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,老天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holy Christ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.12,0:33:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么都不剩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holy Christ, there's nothing left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.56,0:33:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你的身体不在 但你人还在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your body may have gone, but you're still here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.72,0:34:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那甚至不是我的脑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's not even my brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.60,0:34:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须修复受损区域{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We had to repair the damaged areas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.88,0:34:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但没有干扰你的情绪或智力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But we didn't interfere with your emotion or your intellect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.44,0:34:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你了解吗？艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you understand me, Alex?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.36,0:34:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是有主控权{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're in control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.92,0:34:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我有主控权？- 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I'm in control? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.12,0:34:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.56,0:34:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我有主控权{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I'm in control,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.28,0:34:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那我想死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then I wanna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.52,0:34:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,把所有插头拔掉 结束这场噩梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just unplug whatever it is keepin' me alive and end this nightmare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.32,0:34:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, say I did that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.32,0:34:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然不可能 但假使我做了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which as a doctor would almost be impossible for me, but say I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.84,0:34:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么跟你老婆交代？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do I say to your wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.68,0:34:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,她要怎么跟你儿子说？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What does she say to your son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.48,0:34:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,就说没有用 你尽力了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That it didn't work. That you tried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.16,0:35:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,说出了问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Somethin' went wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.72,0:35:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,能做的都做了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You did everything you could,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.52,0:35:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,但我还是死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.20,0:35:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他们承受 经历所有痛苦跟期待{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So after all they've been through, all the pain, all their hope restored,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.72,0:35:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你要剥夺他们的希望？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we would just rip that away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.32,0:35:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你老婆爱你 艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your wife loves you, Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.72,0:35:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,她亲手签同意书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She signed the consent forms herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.68,0:35:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,否则 你不能动手术{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Otherwise, you couldn't have undergone the procedure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.16,0:35:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,她爱你 她给你第二个机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She loves you and she gave you a second chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.04,0:35:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你接受这个机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need you to take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.00,0:35:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我不要再看见我自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't wanna see myself like this again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.16,0:35:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,永远不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.36,0:35:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我家人也一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the same goes for my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.20,0:36:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,把我装回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just put me back in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.56,0:36:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,拉近{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Zoom in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.04,0:36:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,停{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.12,0:36:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,拉近{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Zoom in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.64,0:36:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,停{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.12,0:36:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,接受连线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Accept the connection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.16,0:36:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我好高兴终于看见你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's so good to finally see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.52,0:36:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我也很高兴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was gonna say the same thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.04,0:36:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.44,0:36:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我看起来很怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know how I must look to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.00,0:36:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来很美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think you look beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.20,0:36:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝 他们对你好吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are they treating you okay, baby?{\r}
