Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.44,0:37:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不过他们说很顺利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But they're sayin' it's goin' really well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.48,0:37:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,一有机会我就回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The minute they let me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.40,0:37:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我要挂了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.08,0:37:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I love you.{\r}
