Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.60,0:38:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,能量注入1320千卡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Energy inflow is at 1320 kilocalories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.20,0:38:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,开始抗发炎类固醇 贺尔蒙…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now starting anti-inflammatory corticoids, hormones{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.52,0:38:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,及抗生素程序{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and antibiotic protocols.{\r}
