Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.52,0:38:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,注射抗忧郁剂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Release antidepressants.{\r}
