Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.72,0:39:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,TSR 66 卡匣式电击枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}TSR 66. Cartridge-driven taser pistol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.04,0:39:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,每次二十万伏 可制伏或杀死人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Each projectile releases up to 200,000 volts. It can stun, it can kill{\r}
