Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.28,0:39:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,最新装甲 但不是射不穿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your armor, state-of-the-art, but not invulnerable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.92,0:39:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,点50或更大口径就能杀死你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}.50 caliber or larger can penetrate and kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.64,0:39:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,多中几枪 你猜谁会被资源回收{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Multiple hits, and guess who ends up in the recycling bin?{\r}
