Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.20,0:40:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我的工作？机器人就是我的工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just stick to my job? Combat robots are my job, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.20,0:40:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的机器在世界各地完美运作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rio, Congo, you name it, I was there. Our machines run perfectly.{\r}
