Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.36,0:42:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,墨菲警探恢复迅速{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Detective Murphy making a speedy recovery."{\r}
