Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.94,0:42:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,就擅自调查范伦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}wasn't authorized in the first place.{\r}
