Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.32,0:42:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,没有证据显示范伦企图杀他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have absolutely no evidence linking Vallon to the attempt on his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.52,0:42:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想说我的搭档是个好警察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All I'm gonna say is my partner's a great cop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.92,0:43:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定要抓到想杀他的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I won't rest until the men who tried to kill him are brought to justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.28,0:43:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他有什么问题？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's wrong with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.36,0:43:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, nothing, nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.64,0:43:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你看208的反应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Watch the procedural bars on the 208.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.92,0:43:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,评估威胁 做出反应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The machine assesses the threat and acts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.04,0:43:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.92,0:43:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,只需两步骤 但你看艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's two steps. Now watch Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.36,0:43:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,软体评估威胁 和机器一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The software assesses the threat, just like the robot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.60,0:43:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,把资讯传到大脑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And it sends the information to the brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.64,0:43:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯的大脑接受讯息然后…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex's brain receives the information and decides what to do with it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.48,0:43:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,像一般人一样由情绪认知下决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}based on his emotional cognitive abilities like any man would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.28,0:43:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,大脑再与人工智慧模组相连…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then the brain relates this to the Al module and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.60,0:43:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,慢上一整年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, like, you know, a year later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.40,0:43:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,由电脑完成工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And our computers finish the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.76,0:43:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你要把人放进机器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Raymond, you wanted a man inside a machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.56,0:43:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是结果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And that's what you've got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.20,0:43:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,人类元素一定会存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But the human element will always be present.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.44,0:43:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,人的各种情绪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fear, instinct, bias, compassion,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.08,0:43:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,都会干扰系统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they will always interfere with the system!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.44,0:43:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 但是 丹尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, but, Dennett,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.04,0:44:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须给美国人能支持的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've gotta give the American people something they can root for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.56,0:44:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,能激励人心对吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Something aspirational, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.40,0:44:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,让人相信的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They have to believe in this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.96,0:44:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,"普通好"不够 我不会卖普通{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Pretty good"? I don't know how to sell "Okay".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.48,0:44:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,快上市了 我们一定要成功{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We, you and I, have got a release date, and we've gotta make it, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.68,0:44:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我不管你怎么做 我只求你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So I don't care how you do it. I'm askin' ya, come on, can you help me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.36,0:44:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,让他变成那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just get him to do that. Get him to do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.92,0:44:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那是机器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is a machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.40,0:44:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 但人在机器里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know, but it's a man inside a machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.96,0:44:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 这就是人在机器里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, that's a man inside a machine right there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.92,0:44:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他的命就靠这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And his life depends on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.08,0:44:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,欧姆尼的未来也靠这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the future of Omnicorp depends on it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.52,0:44:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,所以回去中国修好这个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so get your ass back to China and get it fixed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.44,0:44:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我不管你怎么做 做就对了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't care how you do it, just go do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.12,0:44:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,有花生酱的味道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It tastes like peanut butter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.16,0:44:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我没办法把味道弄掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't get it out of my mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.04,0:44:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你不喜欢花生酱？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you don't like peanut butter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.96,0:44:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不喜欢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.92,0:45:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,金 你喜欢花生酱吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You like peanut butter, Kim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.64,0:45:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I love it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.80,0:45:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.24,0:45:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在要让你睡觉 艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm gonna put you to sleep now, Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.92,0:45:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.24,0:45:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,让他睡觉 金{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, put him under, Kim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.64,0:45:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你打算怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you planning to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.32,0:45:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,认知不过是…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Consciousness is nothing more{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.40,0:45:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,资讯的处理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}than the processing of information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.64,0:45:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我要操控他的认知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm gonna fix him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.88,0:45:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但他不会发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And he won't know the difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.32,0:45:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 雷蒙？- 什么事？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Raymond? - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.00,0:45:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在监狱做焦点小组测试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We just ran focus groups at Ryan Correctional Facility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.32,0:45:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这叫"作战模式"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We call this Combat Mode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.60,0:45:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,真的能让受刑人害怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It really put the fear of God into the prisoners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.48,0:45:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好 还可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, that's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.76,0:46:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,看一下这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And get a load of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.28,0:46:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么？- 改变后小孩子爱死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What's that? - He transforms. Kids love it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.44,0:46:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的吗？- 焦点小组的反应很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Really? - Focus group numbers through the roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.92,0:46:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗？- 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Really? - Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.44,0:46:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,真是难看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, that's really embarrassing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.56,0:46:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？你知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is this? You know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.68,0:46:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,人们对那些他们之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}People really don't know what they want{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.67,0:46:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,没看过的东西没有概念{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until you show it to 'em most of the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.64,0:46:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,把他变得更…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make him more, uh,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.00,0:46:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,更有战斗力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}tactical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.08,0:46:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,让他看起来…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make him look, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.80,0:46:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,把装甲变黑色{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's go with black.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.84,0:46:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.20,0:47:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.36,0:47:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他看起来造价昂贵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He looks like a billion dollars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.60,0:47:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,26亿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}2.6 billion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.04,0:47:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我是雷蒙赛勒斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Raymond Sellars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.08,0:47:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴终于见到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've looked forward to meeting you, Detective.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.04,0:47:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你为我做的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I really appreciate everything you've done for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.20,0:47:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这个计划就是要帮助像你这种人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, we funded this program to give men like you a second chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.56,0:47:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,尽全力就好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You just do your best today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.72,0:47:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可以开始了吗？- 开始吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Shall we? - Let's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.08,0:47:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 赛勒斯先生 欢迎 - 很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Mr. Sellars, we're ready for you. - Okay, great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.72,0:47:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,首席技术员舒曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Chief Technician Shuman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.36,0:47:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,早安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mornin', folks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.84,0:47:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下的流程是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay, so this is how it's gonna be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.24,0:47:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们俩对决 先倒下的人输{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're goin' toe-to-toe. Last man standing wins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.04,0:47:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你输的话要重新设计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hit you, you go back to the drawing board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.32,0:47:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,赢了就搭飞机回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You hit me, you get a ticket back home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.00,0:47:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我的机器人发射点47的子弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My guys are gonna be shootin' .47 caliber rounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.84,0:47:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这些子弹不会让你倒下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do a little damage, but they can't take you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.16,0:47:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不过别搞错 我的枪会让你倒下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But make no mistake, Tin Man, my gun will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.92,0:48:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex, listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.64,0:48:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,EM-208会试着让梅托斯射你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The EM-208s will try to maneuver you so Mattox can get a clear shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.04,0:48:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,别被射中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not let that happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.64,0:48:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,要是梅托斯射中你 否则系统会关机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If Mattox hits you, everything but your life support will shut down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.08,0:48:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你会感受到不曾经历过的疼痛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You'll feel more pain than you've ever felt in your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.52,0:48:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？我想我经历过不少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know about that. I've been through a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.24,0:48:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.28,0:48:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,数到三开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I say we go on three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.32,0:48:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,三{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.32,0:49:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那边感觉如何？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How's it going down there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.04,0:49:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何 不要被射到脸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whatever you do, don't get shot in the face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.52,0:49:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,哇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.72,0:49:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,诺顿博士 他怎么做到的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dr. Norton, how is he doing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.32,0:49:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他的软体更快 硬体更强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His software is faster. His hardware is stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.00,0:49:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他是更好的机器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's a better machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.12,0:50:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但你说人会迟疑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But you said humans hesitate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.52,0:50:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,只有在下决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only when they're making decisions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.88,0:50:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不是他在下决定？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's not making decisions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.00,0:50:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是也不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes and no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.12,0:50:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,在日常生活 人类的规则凌驾于机器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In his everyday life, man rules over the machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.12,0:50:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,由艾力克斯决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex makes his own decisions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.56,0:50:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但一交战时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, when he engages in battle,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.48,0:50:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,软体就取得主控权{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the visor comes down and the software takes over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.84,0:50:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,然后机器负责所有事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then the machine does everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.88,0:50:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯只是过客 就像乘客{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex is a passenger, just along for the ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.76,0:50:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,但是机器负责时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But if the machine is in control,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.24,0:50:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,主导墨菲什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then how is Murphy accountable?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.88,0:50:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁扣下板机？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who's pulling the trigger?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.96,0:50:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦交战时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, when the machine fights,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.40,0:50:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,系统释放信号到艾力克斯的大脑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the system releases signals into Alex's brain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.00,0:50:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,让他以为他在做电脑做的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}making him think he's doing what our computers are actually doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.68,0:50:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 艾力克斯以为是他在控制{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean, Alex believes right now he is in control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.60,0:50:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,其实不是 只是自由意志的幻觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But he's not. It's the illusion of free will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.76,0:50:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crap!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.20,0:51:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你让机器以为它是人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So you've circumvented the law by creating a machine that thinks it's a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.20,0:51:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这样违法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But that's illegal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.36,0:51:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.28,0:51:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,机器以为它是艾力克斯墨菲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a machine that thinks it's Alex Murphy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.84,0:51:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,在我看来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in my book{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.64,0:51:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这是合法的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that's legal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.04,0:51:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,做得好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.76,0:51:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.64,0:51:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,博士 混球被电击会怎样？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, Doctor, what happens if I tase an exoskeleton with a little asshole inside?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.20,0:51:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也很想知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I, uh, I think we're all curious to find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.64,0:51:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,动手吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.08,0:52:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我有脉搏一定跳很快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I had a pulse, it'd be racing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.08,0:52:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,她等了四个月{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's been waiting four months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.64,0:52:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信她也很紧张{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sure hers is, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.00,0:52:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're gonna do fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.40,0:52:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的海报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I love your sign, D.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.72,0:52:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.24,0:53:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么好紧张的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's nothin' to be nervous about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.68,0:53:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 丹尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you, Dennett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.72,0:53:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我的荣幸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's been a privilege.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.16,0:54:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hi, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.16,0:54:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我很想你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know I missed you, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.88,0:54:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Me, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.40,0:55:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你要摸摸看吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wanna feel it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.72,0:55:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.40,0:55:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's okay, sweetie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.36,0:55:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我有录下红翼队的所有比赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I saved all the Red Wings games on my computer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.20,0:55:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.56,0:55:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们表现如何？- 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- How'd they do? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.72,0:55:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我在等你跟我一起看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've been waiting to watch them with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.32,0:55:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我很想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know I'd love to, kiddo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.00,0:55:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但今晚不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I can't tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.24,0:55:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我的装备需要一些…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, 'cause Daddy's suit needs some...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.76,0:55:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,特殊处理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Some special handling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.16,0:55:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你了解吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.00,0:56:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你来 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thanks for coming, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.48,0:56:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,听说你回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I heard you went home already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.04,0:56:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱拉一定很高兴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know Clara must be thrilled to have you back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.88,0:56:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到克莱拉和大卫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I saw Clara and David.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.28,0:56:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那已经不是我家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That ain't my home right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.80,0:56:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我家现在是该死的实验室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's in a damn lab across the hall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.08,0:56:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我很遗憾 艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sorry, Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.16,0:56:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我明天就要去逮范伦那帮人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Startin' tomorrow, I'm gonna take down Vallon and his whole damn crew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.08,0:56:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我正希望听你这么说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was waitin' to hear you say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.16,0:56:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,至少你现在肤色对了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Least I know you're the right color now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.04,0:57:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,派特 今天这里的低温{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pat, the cooler temperatures here today{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.40,0:57:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,完全没有浇熄民众的热情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}certainly have not stopped people from showing up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.64,0:57:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们期望底特律市每个角落的市民{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're expecting people from every corner of the city{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.20,0:57:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,纷纷走上街头以行动表示他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}here in Detroit to come out and show their support{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.48,0:57:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,对艾力克斯墨菲的支持{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for Detective Alex Murphy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.84,0:57:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,很多人对他的外表感到好奇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, a lot of questions on people's minds today is what will he look like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.68,0:57:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他会变成另一个人吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is he a changed man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.44,0:57:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,消息指出他现在就在警局大楼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rumor has it he is in the building preparing to come out...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.52,0:57:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 现在上传整个底特律警局资料库{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex, we're gonna upload the entire DPD database into your brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.56,0:57:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说你能立即取得犯罪纪录{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That means you'll have instantaneous access to criminal records{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.88,0:58:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,还有2011年到现在的监视器影像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}plus an archive of CCTV footage from 2011 to the present.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.24,0:58:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.20,0:58:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hit me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.00,0:58:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,金 交给你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay. Kim, it's all yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.92,0:58:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,监视器影像上传成功{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Archive footage uploading successfully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.64,0:58:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你的系统会自动连线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your system draws connections automatically.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.32,0:58:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这会连接肇事者的犯罪记录{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will link perpetrators to their crimes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.24,0:58:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,和他们的具体位置传送给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and give you their exact locations whenever available.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.20,0:58:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我有证据可以逮捕138名…不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I got evidence to make 138... No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.76,0:58:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,166名罪犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}166 arrests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.68,0:58:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他的情绪稳定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His emotions are stable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.24,0:58:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不可思议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is incredible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.40,0:58:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他的家人现在也在警局里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will notice his family is here in the building as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.08,0:58:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,市长现在已经上台{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The mayor is standing onstage behind me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.28,0:58:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,还有欧姆尼企业的雷蒙赛勒斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Also, Raymond Sellars from Omnicorp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.52,0:58:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他们看来交情很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They seem like great friends{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.84,0:58:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,显然他们合作愉快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}obviously echoing the partnership that they've brought together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.04,0:58:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,还需要多久？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How much longer will this take?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.44,0:58:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,资料库快上传好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, the feed from the database is almost done, so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.68,0:58:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在要上传最近的资料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're approaching present day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.36,0:58:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,634名罪犯待捕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}634 pending arrests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.96,0:58:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要更大的监狱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're gonna need a bigger prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.80,0:59:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他压在她身上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's on top of her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.04,0:59:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,诺顿博士 他太激动了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dr. Norton, he's getting too emotional.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.96,0:59:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我得阻止他 - 艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I gotta do something! - Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.64,0:59:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 冷静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex, calm down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.28,0:59:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,深呼吸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take a breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.96,0:59:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,放轻松{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.64,0:59:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,金 读数怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kim, what are the readings?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.96,0:59:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我没见过这么高的读数{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I haven't seen him at levels like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.92,0:59:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他要开枪射他们 - 艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- He's gonna shoot 'em! - Alex!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.28,0:59:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 放轻松{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex, Alex, relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.48,0:59:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,放轻松{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.48,0:59:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.16,0:59:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事？- 电脑故障吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What is this? - This just a computer glitch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.32,0:59:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这是他受害当天的影像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. That's his own crime scene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.16,0:59:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.24,0:59:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他太激动了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's spiking all over the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.32,0:59:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.16,0:59:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 艾力克斯 - 系统会当机 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Alex? - The system is crashing, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.08,0:59:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 听得见吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex, can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.72,0:59:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex! Alex!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.92,0:59:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不确定他能不能承受 - 我一定要马上处理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I'm not sure he can handle this. - I gotta do something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.16,0:59:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他情绪高涨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's emotionally overloaded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.40,0:59:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unlock me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.56,0:59:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 停止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.48,0:59:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,停止 他痉挛发作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop! He's having a seizure!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.28,0:59:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,金 快关机 艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kim, shut him down! Alex!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.48,0:59:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我要和博士讲话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get me a live feed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.60,0:59:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 博士和病人一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't do it. Dr. Norton's with the patient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.84,0:59:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do it now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.00,0:59:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,老天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Jesus Christ!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.28,0:59:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,诺顿博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dr. Norton! Dr. Norton!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.08,0:59:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 媒体在等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What? - The press is waiting!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.64,0:59:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他该出去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have to get him up there now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.72,0:59:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你没看见他变这样？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you want me to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.92,0:59:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,修好他 该怎么做就做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know! Fix him! Do what you have to do!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.88,1:00:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这攸关你和我们的名声{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your reputation is on the line every bit as much as ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.56,1:00:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,没时间了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're running out of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.20,1:00:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.68,1:00:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人都出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everybody out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.68,1:00:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.76,1:00:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,市长即将介绍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mayor Durant is about to take to the stage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.36,1:00:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,底特律打击犯罪的最新武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and introduce Detroit's newest weapon in the war on crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.04,1:00:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,市长现在要开始致词{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm actually getting word that he's ready to go right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.84,1:00:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,心跳加速 他又开始激动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Heart rate rising. He might start spiking, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.16,1:00:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,清除多巴胺和正肾上腺素{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Set modules to absorb dopamine and noradrenalin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.88,1:00:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,但他的情绪会消失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But you'll be taking away his emotions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.12,1:00:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,照我说的做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Drop the levels until I tell you to stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.96,1:00:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他会没办法感受任何事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Doctor, you'll be taking away his ability to feel anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.04,1:00:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.04,1:00:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,重复播放他遇害的影像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pull the footage. Put it on a loop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.88,1:00:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,多巴胺浓度20%{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dopamine level's at 20%.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.56,1:00:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,再降低{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}More.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.16,1:00:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,多巴胺10%{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dopamine level's at 10%.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.40,1:00:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,再低{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}More.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.56,1:00:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 多巴胺5% - 再低{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Dopamine level's at 5%. - Lower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.52,1:01:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他已经没感觉了 - 再低{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You're flattening him out. - Lower!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.08,1:01:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 2% - 维持这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- 2%. - Hold it there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.16,1:01:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.76,1:01:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 你感觉如何？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex, how do you feel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.76,1:01:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 诺顿博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I feel fine, Dr. Norton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.56,1:01:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我要谈的不是犯罪预防{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, today I'm not here to talk about crime prevention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.44,1:01:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,而是解决方案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am here to give you the cure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.92,1:01:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.60,1:01:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hi, Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.12,1:01:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,爸？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.24,1:01:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,改革从现在开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ladies and gentlemen, the revolution begins right now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.04,1:01:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎艾力克斯墨菲警探{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with Detective Alex Murphy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.04,1:02:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,警探{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Detective.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.00,1:02:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他在干嘛？- 他活像个僵尸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What's he doing? - He looks like a zombie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.00,1:02:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他正在搜寻犯罪资料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think he's accessing criminal data.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.36,1:02:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,汤玛士金 你被捕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thomas King! You are under arrest!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.04,1:03:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,今天以前 汤玛士金这个罪犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Until today, Thomas King was a convicted felon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.84,1:03:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,犯下强暴 纵火及谋杀罪行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}wanted for rape, arson, and murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.68,1:03:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这个人造成许多美国家庭破碎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This man has torn apart American families.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.96,1:03:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他在逃六年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On the loose for six years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.48,1:03:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这个狡猾的罪犯躲在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And where was this criminal mastermind hiding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.72,1:03:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,就在警察局总部前面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right in front of the police headquarters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.84,1:03:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他离警察只有几步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here he is, just steps away from two of Detroit's finest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.56,1:03:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这两名警察完全不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These two officers are completely unaware{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.56,1:03:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,坏人就在人群之中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the monster in their midst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.88,1:03:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,然后 在60秒内{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then, in 60 seconds...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.56,1:03:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我重复 只花了60秒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I repeat, just 60 seconds,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.72,1:03:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,墨菲警探就把他绳之以法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Detective Murphy brings him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.28,1:04:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你无力负担我们会指派律师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you cannot afford an attorney, one will be provided for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.00,1:04:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 这就是美国正义的未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This, my friends, is the future of American justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.76,1:04:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,多少个汤玛士金要为他们的罪行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How many like Thomas King will pay for their crimes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.04,1:04:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,付出代价？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}now that RoboCop is here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.08,1:04:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.28,1:04:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不要逃避这个话题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}let's not shy away from what this means, people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.28,1:04:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,人无法胜任这项工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Men weren't up to the task.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.36,1:04:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但是艾力克斯墨菲…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But Alex Murphy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.20,1:04:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,一个机器战警…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a robot cop,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.24,1:04:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,能胜任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.56,1:04:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能把他收起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We can't take him off the street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.96,1:04:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我所说的 他大受欢迎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is what I'm saying. He's a hit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.60,1:04:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他是当红炸子鸡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A big, fat, stinking hit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.36,1:04:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊 等他在街上崩溃就完了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, until he breaks down in front of everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.72,1:04:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都知道可能会有问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, we all knew there would be issues. It's inevitable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.08,1:04:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,丹尼 我相信你能解决这个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dennett, you're my guy. I just need you to get a handle on this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.76,1:04:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,但我需要时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know, but I need more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.96,1:04:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这状况没人碰过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Scientifically, we're in uncharted water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.56,1:04:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他必须回实验室做更多测试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We need to take him back to the lab and do more tests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.80,1:04:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好像有东西在干扰我们的系统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean, it was like something was interfering with our system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.32,1:04:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,化学或物理之外的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Something beyond chemistry or physics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.88,1:04:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,像什么？他的灵魂？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Like what? His soul?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.80,1:05:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 现在不能临时喊卡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, look, this train has already left the station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.40,1:05:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能出去向外界说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't exactly go out to the world and say,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.76,1:05:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉产品有瑕疵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Sorry, I released a defective product."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.44,1:05:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,所以不论如何 他必须待在街上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, no matter what we do, we just need to keep him on the streets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.48,1:05:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,媒体访问呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What about the interviews?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.16,1:05:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,取消 全部取消{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cancel 'em. Cancel all of 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.76,1:05:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,取消所有宣传{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.80,1:05:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上 丹尼…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In fact, Dennett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.96,1:05:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,也让他家人保持距离{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's keep the wife at a distance for now, as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.00,1:05:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我想见他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd like to see him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.12,1:05:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以帮我安排吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can you arrange that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.64,1:05:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想骗你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, I won't lie to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.00,1:05:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯很紧张 我们必须镇静他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex was so nervous, we had to sedate him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.60,1:05:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我看着他眼睛 我看不见我老公{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I looked in his eyes and I couldn't see my husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.36,1:05:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他在儿子面前开枪 这不是镇静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then he just shoots a man in front of our son. That's not sedation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.48,1:05:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他现在对药物的反应不一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's responding to drugs differently now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.64,1:05:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们从一开始就知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We both knew from day one,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.64,1:05:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,可能有副作用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there would be complications.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.44,1:05:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,再给我一点时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just give me a little more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.44,1:06:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I promise,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.16,1:06:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你老公会回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you'll have your husband back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.40,1:06:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,各部门的各小队都一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This goes for every squad in every department.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.36,1:06:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,墨菲警探可以插手所有调查{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Detective Murphy will have full access to all investigations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.96,1:06:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,抢劫 毒品 凶杀案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Robberies, narcotics, homicides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.68,1:06:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,要是他要求接手 案子就归他管{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If he requests to take over a case, the case will be handed to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.96,1:06:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,没有异议 不准抱怨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No arguments, no complaints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.88,1:06:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,太扯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is bullshit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.08,1:06:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我说不准抱怨 我是认真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I said no complaints! And I mean it. Now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.68,1:06:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,早安 局长 各位警官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good morning, Chief Dean. Good morning, officers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.72,1:06:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我今天选了13个谋杀通缉犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've selected 13 targets for today, all wanted for murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.24,1:06:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰毕格斯是第一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}John Biggs is target number one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.08,1:06:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我会接手这个案子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll be taking over this case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.56,1:06:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,救护车 警车 验尸官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ambulances, detention vehicles, and coroners{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.40,1:06:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,全部待命 我随时召唤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}should be ready to move in on my request.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.16,1:06:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,祝各位今天愉快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wish you all a very good day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.56,1:06:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,墨菲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Murphy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.44,1:06:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You okay, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.72,1:07:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我很好 警官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm fine, Sergeant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.92,1:07:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,等不及要去抓坏人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can't wait to get back to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.88,1:07:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,雷克和丹尼尔一定紧张死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lake and Daniels are in there shittin' their pants...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.76,1:07:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我有案子要办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Excuse me, I have casework.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.32,1:08:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不要开枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't shoot! Don't shoot! Don't shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.32,1:08:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,华特凯洛 看着我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Walter Karrel, look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.48,1:08:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你有两个选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have two options.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.92,1:08:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,第一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Option one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.96,1:08:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我用五万伏特电击你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shoot you with 50,000 volts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.00,1:08:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,可能造成呼吸衰竭 器官失常{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which may cause respiratory failure, organ malfunction,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.44,1:08:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,内部灼烧 大小便失禁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}internal burns, and loss of bowel and bladder control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.92,1:08:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我逮捕你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then I arrest you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.80,1:08:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,第二 你告诉我约翰毕格斯在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Option two. You tell me where John Biggs' drug lab is located.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.84,1:08:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我逮捕你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then I arrest you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.68,1:08:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你有两秒钟决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have two seconds to decide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.76,1:09:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,完全合法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Totally justifiable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.16,1:09:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要发大财了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are going to make a lot of money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.60,1:09:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,没有恐惧 没有心跳加速{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing. No fear. No increase in heart rate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.44,1:09:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没有一丝愤怒或任何情绪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No traces of anger whatsoever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.04,1:09:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜 博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Congratulations, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.68,1:09:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你做到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.28,1:09:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我做到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.12,1:10:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I told you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.60,1:10:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,诺顿根本无法控制这个产品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Norton clearly never had control of the product.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.56,1:10:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我同意 所以我把你找来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I agree. And that's why I called you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.76,1:10:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你盯着这个计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I just want a second pair of eyes on this thing, that's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.64,1:10:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.80,1:10:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我要取得锡人视像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll need a feed from the Tin Man's head{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.80,1:10:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,监视整个实验室 以及…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}plus full surveillance of the lab, and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.04,1:10:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你能取得所有东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're gonna have full access to everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.64,1:10:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,若要找我 我会在华盛顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If anything comes up, I'm gonna be in Washington.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.32,1:10:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他带来和平{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He brought peace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.76,1:10:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,即使在美国最暴力的城市{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to this country's most violent city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.48,1:10:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他让所有人看到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He showed us all{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.64,1:10:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,底特律和美国有更美好的未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that Detroit and America can have a brighter future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.00,1:10:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚我们邀请有远见 爱国的…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On tonight's show, a visionary and true patriot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.16,1:10:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,欧姆尼企业执行长赛勒斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The CEO of Omnicorp, Raymond Sellars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.16,1:10:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好 派特 - 雷蒙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Hello, Pat. - Raymond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.24,1:10:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你邀请我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thanks for havin' me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.44,1:11:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在一定开始庆祝了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must be doing a victory lap about now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.00,1:11:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这个嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.08,1:11:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,两周前 欧姆尼的股价一飞冲天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two weeks ago, Omni's stock went through the roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.12,1:11:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,以及参议院最终同意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the Senate has finally agreed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.52,1:11:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,表决废除崔佛斯法案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to vote on the repeal of the Dreyfus Act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.64,1:11:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,舆论终于转向{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, look, I mean, the tide is definitely turning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.20,1:11:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我想机器战警很快就能捍卫美国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I just feel certain that soon we'll be keeping all Americans safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.12,1:11:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我也这么希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I certainly hope so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.48,1:11:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但下一位来宾有不同的观点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But, I think our next guest will have a different point of view.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.52,1:11:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mmm-hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.88,1:11:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,修伯崔佛斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hubert Dreyfus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.52,1:11:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,参议员 谢谢你上节目{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Senator, thank you for joining us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.52,1:11:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,派特你好 赛勒斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hello, Pat. Mr. Sellars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.32,1:11:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,参议员 你知道这是什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Senator, do you know what this is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.80,1:11:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,美国民众对崔佛斯法案的意见分歧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The American public is divided on the Dreyfus Act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.20,1:11:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们网站上的民调结果平手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our polls at Novakelement.com are tight at 50-50.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.56,1:11:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,毫无疑问 欧姆尼企业引起关注{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no doubt Omnicorp created a sensation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.40,1:11:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,但这法案不是关于艾力克斯墨菲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but this bill is not about Alex Murphy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.96,1:11:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,而是要不要让机器人掌握{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's about whether America's willing to give robots{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.00,1:11:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,人类的生杀大权{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the authority over human lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.72,1:11:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不 听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. Look, look, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.56,1:11:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们观察到的舆论转向 让我们知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This sea change we're witnessing, and it is a sea change,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.64,1:12:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,美国人不在意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}shows that Americans don't really care{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.40,1:12:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,执法人员是不是人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if our law enforcement systems are manned or unmanned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.24,1:12:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他们关心的是效率和安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What they care about is efficiency and they care about safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.36,1:12:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你在模糊焦点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're clouding the issue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.68,1:12:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你们推出墨菲就是为了改变舆论{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is clearly an attempt to sway public opinion with a marketing stunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.92,1:12:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,很明显的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's clear is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.40,1:12:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,一个机器人就让犯罪率降低80%{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that with just one system in place, we've cut crime by 80%.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.96,1:12:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,想像如果有100个机器人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just imagine if we put, I dunno, let's say 100 systems in place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.56,1:12:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我想知道你为什么要反对？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then, I want you to ask yourself, why are you holding us back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.40,1:12:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是你的计划？- 谢谢你 参议员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Is that your plan? - Thank you, Senator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.88,1:12:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 雷蒙 - 谢谢 派特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- And thank you, Raymond. - Thank you, Pat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.92,1:12:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都听到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, there you have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.28,1:12:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,谁会反对降低犯罪？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who could argue with that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.28,1:12:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,难道说…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which begs the question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.04,1:12:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,美国参议院支持犯罪？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Has the US Senate become pro-crime?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.16,1:12:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.48,1:12:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不 五千{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no, 5000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.64,1:12:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,明天打给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Call me tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.36,1:13:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 范伦在等你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, guys. Vallon's waitin' for you inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.12,1:13:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你不陪我们进去？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What, you too busy to walk us in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.60,1:13:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我在努力工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm out here makin' money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.28,1:13:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我要的陷阱呢？难道要我自己做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where are my trip wires? I gotta do this myself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.48,1:13:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们怎么这么慢？- 怎么堆满这些东西？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What took you so long? - What the hell is all this shit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.96,1:13:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙在街上我没办法卖货{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't move any product with this thing on the streets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.52,1:13:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你们根本没给我保护{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you doing to protect me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.20,1:13:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,放轻松 那家伙是僵尸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Relax. The guy's a walkin' zombie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.32,1:13:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的电话关机了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And tell me your phones are off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.96,1:13:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会来抓你 我们行踪很隐密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's not going after you. We covered our tracks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.32,1:13:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他不能捏造证据{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He can't manufacture evidence outta thin air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.64,1:13:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,就算他来 我也不怕他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If he does, I'm ready for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.08,1:13:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.00,1:13:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我接到电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've been getting calls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.52,1:13:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,谁的电话？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From whom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.32,1:13:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, Clara.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.88,1:13:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须让她见她丈夫 她有权利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You need to let her see her husband. She has rights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.24,1:13:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不是你说了算 这由法律决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's not your decision. That's Legal's call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.40,1:13:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,对 但她迟早会向媒体爆料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, but it's only a question of time before she turns up on television.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.00,1:13:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,她可以试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, she can try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.20,1:14:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我会对她下封口令才让她见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll issue a gag order before I let her see her husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.52,1:14:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,真是个好主意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd hop to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.68,1:14:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex. Alex!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.68,1:14:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 你必须回家一趟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex. You need to come home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.64,1:14:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱拉 请让开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Clara, please stand aside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.20,1:14:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须和大卫谈谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You need to speak to your son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.72,1:14:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,现在有三起犯罪进行中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right now, I see three crimes in progress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.84,1:14:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex, listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.72,1:14:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你在里面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know you're in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.16,1:14:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫不肯去上学{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}David won't show his face at school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.32,1:14:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他晚上做恶梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's having nightmares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.68,1:14:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他快撑不住 我也快撑不住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's falling apart. I am falling apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.68,1:14:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.72,1:14:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我自己办不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't do this on my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.28,1:14:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你出事那晚他吓坏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's been scared ever since that night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.88,1:14:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得她会怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you think she's gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.20,1:14:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他会怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's he gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.60,1:15:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.08,1:15:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}David? David.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.92,1:15:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,退后 请退后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stand back. Come on, stand back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.76,1:15:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他应该要看这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's supposed to be watching this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.96,1:15:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,但他选择看大卫到学校的影像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Instead, he's accessing images of Clara and David arriving at school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.64,1:15:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,重复看好几次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Over and over again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.52,1:15:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他覆写系统的优先权{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Somehow, he's overriding the system's priorities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.20,1:16:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你要我把他关掉吗？- 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Do you want me to shut him down? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.44,1:16:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.32,1:16:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我想看会发生什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wanna see what happens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.96,1:16:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他到他家干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's he doing at his house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.00,1:16:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,看吧 他没遵守程序{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, he's disobeying protocol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.12,1:16:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你该把他关掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have to shut him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.68,1:16:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得他还是在做他的工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As far as I can tell, he's still doing his job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.28,1:17:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,给我他脑的影像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Adrian, give me an image of his brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.72,1:17:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他解除我们对他的设定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's undoing what we did to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.60,1:17:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他的多巴胺回到正常浓度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His dopamine levels are coming back to normal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.44,1:17:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这怎么可能？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How is that even possible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.08,1:18:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I haven't the faintest idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.76,1:18:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.60,1:18:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 拜托你回局里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex, please return to the station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.00,1:18:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我要做一些测试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wanna run some tests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.64,1:18:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这下好玩了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, this should be interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.32,1:18:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你电话拿来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And your phone on the table!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.60,1:18:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是警察 我们替范伦工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're not cops, all right? We work for Antoine Vallon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.00,1:19:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇哦 - 你说什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Whoa! - What'd you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.00,1:19:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们替安东尼范伦工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We work for Antoine Vallon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.68,1:19:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我的手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My hand, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.08,1:19:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,安东尼范伦在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where's Antoine Vallon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.36,1:19:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你弄断我的手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You broke my hand, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.36,1:19:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你记得我 杰瑞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know you remember me, Jerry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.28,1:19:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,范伦在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where's Vallon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.52,1:19:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,等下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.68,1:19:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉你他会杀掉我老婆和小孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I tell you where Vallon is, he'll kill my wife and kid, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.00,1:19:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你老婆2019年告你家暴诉请离婚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your wife left you in 2019 after filing charges for domestic abuse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.32,1:19:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有小孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you don't have a kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.68,1:19:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.24,1:19:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会问第二次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not askin' again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.68,1:20:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓 我不知道他在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, I swear, man. I don't know where Vallon is, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.92,1:20:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我只和他司机马可仕联络 真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The only guy I talk to is his driver Marcus. That's it, man. That's it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.84,1:20:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他有电话吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does he have a phone number?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.08,1:20:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,有麻烦了 艾力克斯不遵守程序{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have a problem. Alex is breaking protocol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.44,1:20:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他在干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's he doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.60,1:20:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他在侦办他自己的谋杀案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's off solving his own murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.92,1:20:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,真是天才{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, that is genius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.08,1:20:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么没想到？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why didn't I think Of that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.76,1:20:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他多久会到？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How long till he gets here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.44,1:20:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 五分钟 - 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Five minutes. - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.80,1:20:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,强尼 你看着监视器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Johnny, you stay on these monitors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.64,1:20:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.24,1:20:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,有白痴用未加密电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Some idiot used an unencrypted phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.28,1:20:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.64,1:21:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你们听好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, everyone, listen up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.64,1:21:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.12,1:21:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不干掉他 你们就死定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He leaves alive, you don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.12,1:21:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,要怎么杀他？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How do we stop him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.16,1:21:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,用点50以上的子弹 瞄准头部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}.50 caliber and above. Aim for the head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.32,1:21:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,设定好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This one's set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.08,1:21:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's go. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.44,1:21:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好 走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, move! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.16,1:21:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.76,1:21:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,可以了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ready to go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.80,1:21:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,炸弹装好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're all set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.12,1:23:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Finish it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.80,1:23:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧 怪胎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You freak, die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.36,1:24:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Watch out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.96,1:24:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,要找医生吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Need me to call a doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.60,1:24:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来 杰克 你会喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on, Jack. You're gonna like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.32,1:24:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,干什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What the hell you doin' here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.48,1:24:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你想玩好警察配坏警察？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Y'all gonna play good cop, bad cop?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.84,1:24:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 是坏警察配机器战警{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nah, Daniels. Bad cop, RoboCop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.52,1:24:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我在范伦仓库找到26把枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've recovered 26 guns from Vallon's warehouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.84,1:24:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,13把符合证物室失踪的编号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thirteen serial numbers match weapons missing from Evidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.80,1:24:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,上面布满你们的指纹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I got your prints all over 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.80,1:24:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你胡说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.96,1:24:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我有你们和范伦密那天企图谋杀我的影像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I also have CCTV footage of you and Vallon the same day he tried to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.00,1:24:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那就收买他 有什么问题？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So put him on the payroll. Why we talkin' about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.32,1:24:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会收 现在他搭档又受伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It won't work. Now that his partner got hit, he's never gonna let it go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.80,1:24:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么？- 路易斯住的医院{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What is that? - Lewis' hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.40,1:24:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,墨菲下午会去探病{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Murphy's dropping by this afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.00,1:24:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,杀警察要躲一辈子…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I kill a cop, I'm lookin' over my shoulder...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.04,1:25:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道警察在牢里的下场吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know what they do to cops in prison, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.80,1:25:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,和被你们抓的人关一起？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Being locked up with the same dudes you put in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.72,1:25:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得他会不会出卖你？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How long you think before he gives you up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.20,1:25:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不要杀我 拜托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't shoot me. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.88,1:25:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓 是局长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I swear to Christ. It was Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.36,1:25:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是她偷枪出去 不要杀我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She helped pull those guns. Just don't shoot me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.20,1:25:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你的合作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you for your cooperation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.32,1:25:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以上手铐了 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can cuff him now, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.96,1:25:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我知道为何抓不到坏人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now I know why we couldn't get an arrest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.16,1:25:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,因为范伦受到你的保护{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}'Cause Vallon was protected from up on high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.36,1:25:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 我可以解释{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex, I can explain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.72,1:25:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你今天给他警告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You tipped him off today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.20,1:25:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 伙计 别这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on, man. Don't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.52,1:25:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经试着杀我两次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You tried to kill me twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.52,1:25:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我信任你 你却毁掉我的家庭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I trusted you. And you destroyed my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.12,1:25:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,认罪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Confess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.44,1:25:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 在所有人面前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, in front of everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.24,1:25:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,认罪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Confess!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.08,1:26:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.24,1:26:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我让锡人倒下 没办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tin Man is down. Had to be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.56,1:26:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.72,1:26:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,产品射杀贪污警官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Product shot a corrupt cop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.04,1:26:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,再慢个两秒 早间新闻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two more seconds, the chief's brains{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.60,1:26:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,头条就是局长被杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would've been splattered across the 6:00 news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.56,1:26:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,她真的有罪？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We got anything on her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.80,1:26:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,她是底特律警局局长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, she's the Chief of the Detroit Police Department.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.24,1:26:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你说呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.92,1:26:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.64,1:26:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这可能刚好助我们一臂之力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This might actually tip this thing right into the net.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.32,1:26:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 我不知道你是否听见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex, I don't know if you can hear me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.80,1:26:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,但今晚 你直捣歹徒的巢穴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But tonight, you uncovered a nest of vipers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.24,1:26:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,就在底特律警察局里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}inside the Detroit Police Department.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.84,1:26:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你让我们看见无价的真相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in so doing, you shed light on an invaluable truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.80,1:26:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是即使是警察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even the police,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.32,1:27:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,誓言保护民众安全的人民褓姆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the men and women who swore to keep us safe,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.12,1:27:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,也可能被收买{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they can be bribed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.28,1:27:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,也可能被贿赂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They can be bought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.76,1:27:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,然而 机器不会被贿赂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Machines, however, are corruption free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.84,1:27:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,美国人可以活在一个…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Americans could be living in a country{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.16,1:27:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,执法有效率而且没有贪腐…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}where law enforcement is not only efficient,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.80,1:27:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,的国家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but incorruptible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.64,1:27:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 艾力克斯 你的所为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you, Alex, for all you've done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.12,1:27:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你做的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And for all that you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.32,1:27:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,墨菲警探现在状况危急{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Detective Murphy is currently in critical condition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.16,1:27:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的医生正在全力抢救{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our doctors are working ceaselessly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.00,1:27:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,但目前情况还不明朗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but, at this time, it is unclear if he will survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.04,1:27:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱因女士 你认为警察涉嫌谋杀墨菲警探{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ms. Kline, how do you think the attempt on Detective Alex Murphy's life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.08,1:27:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是否影响明天的崔佛斯法表决？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will affect tomorrow's vote for the Dreyfus Act?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.48,1:27:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,与此同时 我们现在只关心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At this time, Omnicorp's sole concern{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.44,1:27:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,墨菲警探的伤势复原情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is the full recovery of Detective Murphy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.64,1:27:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,墨菲警探要为他的国家捐躯几次才算够呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How many times does Detective Murphy have to give his life for his country?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.96,1:27:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,希望参议院能投下正确的一票{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I sincerely hope the Senate makes the right vote tomorrow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.92,1:28:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不要让艾力克斯墨菲白白牺牲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so that Alex Murphy's sacrifices will not have been in vain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.20,1:28:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,崔佛斯参议员是我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Senator Dreyfus is my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.52,1:28:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我的导师 是我的支柱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has been my mentor and my strength{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.40,1:28:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,在困难时给我支持{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in times of difficulty on this floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.36,1:28:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管如此 我服务的是俄亥俄州{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But despite all that, I work for the state of Ohio,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.56,1:28:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,选民的安全是我的优先考量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the safety of its citizens is my top priority.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.04,1:28:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我投赞成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So I vote yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.24,1:28:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,崔佛斯法案必须被否决{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Dreyfus Act must be repealed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.88,1:28:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们以39比10领先{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's us ahead, 39 to 10.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.24,1:28:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,参议院联络人说我们会获胜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I spoke to the Senate liaison and it looks like it's in the bag,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.24,1:28:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但和政治人物合作还是要小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but we still have to tread carefully with the politicians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.88,1:28:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,记者在底特律警局现场连线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're here live at DPD headquarters{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.24,1:28:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚克莱拉墨菲发表声明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}where moments ago, Clara Murphy made a shocking statement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.08,1:28:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.36,1:28:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,欧姆尼不让我们探望艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Omnicorp has denied me and my son access to Alex for weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.08,1:28:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我要求知道真相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I demand to know why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.92,1:28:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这种处置不人道 有人必须负责{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This treatment is inhuman and somebody needs to be held accountable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.12,1:29:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们完蛋了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, we're fucked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.08,1:29:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,只要再12票{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, we only need 12 votes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.56,1:29:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,她不会影响投票{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She shouldn't make much difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.20,1:29:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,对 但投票过后呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, but what about after the vote?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.52,1:29:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不该见面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean, those two should not be allowed contact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.44,1:29:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,要是她影响他…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If she starts putting ideas in his head...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.96,1:29:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,带她过来 我来跟她谈…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bring her in. I'll handle the explanation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.80,1:29:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what about Alex?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.36,1:29:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不幸的是 不能一直冰冻他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, unfortunately, we can't just keep him on ice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.28,1:29:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他在警局开枪吓到一些政治人物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The shooting at the station spooked some of the politicians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.88,1:29:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须安抚这些客户{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're our clients. We have to take care of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.56,1:29:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,客户乐见机器降低犯罪率{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're fine when a machine is lowering the murder rate,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.08,1:29:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但不希望有人调查贪腐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but when a man is investigating city politics, they get nervous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.44,1:29:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,首先 他不是人 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right. First off, it's not a man, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.92,1:29:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,它是欧姆尼企业的财产{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's property of Omnicorp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.96,1:29:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,再说你根本不用担心政治{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And politics are the least of your concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.28,1:29:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这东西破了自己的谋杀案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean, this thing solved its own murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.12,1:29:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,难道不会发现我们操控他？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How long till it realizes you haven't been on the level with it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.60,1:29:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,要是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If that happens,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.80,1:29:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,要是这样记者会争相采访他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}every journalist in this country is dying to speak to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.80,1:29:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们创造出一个英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean, we created a hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.32,1:29:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,若他揭发我们就糟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What happens when he opens his mouth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.48,1:29:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,什么比英雄更伟大？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's bigger than a hero?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.88,1:30:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,死掉的英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dead hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.48,1:30:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,叫诺顿过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get me Dr. Norton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.52,1:30:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你搞什么 雷蒙？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is this, Raymond?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.76,1:30:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你派梅托斯监视我 又骗说他有生命危险？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have Mattox spying on me and now this bullshit about a "critical condition"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.92,1:30:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都知道艾力克斯没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know and I know Alex is fine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.80,1:30:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Calm down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.12,1:30:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,丹尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dennett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.80,1:30:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你的研究太伟大 我不…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your work is so good, I don't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.04,1:30:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这跟我的研究无关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, now, this is not about my work!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.48,1:30:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你看见那女人上电视{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You saw the woman on TV!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.56,1:30:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这场闹剧必须停止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This has to stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.52,1:30:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你是对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.52,1:30:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但我问你一件事 丹尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But let me ask you something, Dennett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.68,1:30:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们给艾力克斯墨菲什么样的生活？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What kind of life have we really given Alex Murphy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.20,1:30:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他永远没办法活得像正常人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's never gonna be a normal man, a father, a husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.84,1:30:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,等其他机器人上街 他就…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By the time we put the other units on the street, he's just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.24,1:31:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,丹尼…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dennett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.20,1:31:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们承认吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's face it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.56,1:31:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们失败了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We failed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.52,1:31:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们辜负艾力克斯墨菲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We failed Alex Murphy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.52,1:31:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,但我要你顾全大局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I want you to think about the bigger picture{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.20,1:31:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这才是重点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}because that's what we're talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.84,1:31:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你的工作会被研究数十年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The work you've done with him is gonna be studied for decades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.68,1:31:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你改变历史 丹尼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've changed the face of history, Dennett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.96,1:31:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不再有警察因为执行勤务死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No policeman is ever going to die in the line of duty again{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.00,1:31:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,全都是因为你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}because of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.24,1:31:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你考虑看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You think about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.20,1:31:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我要他的家人受到妥善照顾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want that family taken care of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.24,1:31:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,超过他们的想像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}beyond their wildest dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.80,1:31:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们欠他们的 - 我同意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- We owe them that. - I agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.64,1:31:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我要十年的全额资金赞助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want full funding. Ten years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.36,1:31:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,新职员 我要自己挑人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}New staff, all my own people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.20,1:31:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fantastic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.48,1:31:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,成交{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.84,1:32:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey. What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.44,1:32:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,警卫来了 他们要所有人出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Security's here. They're clearing everyone out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.60,1:32:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不让他醒来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're not waking him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.44,1:32:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不论你做什么 别丢他一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whatever you do, don't leave him alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.40,1:32:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,什么叫不让他醒来？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you mean they're not waking him up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.72,1:32:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,投票结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The voting period has ended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.24,1:32:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,结果已经出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The clerks have tabulated the results.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.92,1:32:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,赞成63票{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The yeas are 63.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.04,1:32:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,反对22票{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The nays are 22.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.84,1:32:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,大部分参议员都投票赞成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A majority of senators have voted in the affirmative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.40,1:32:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,崔佛斯法案正式被否决{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Dreyfus Act has been repealed by Congress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.68,1:32:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你们动作真慢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}God, you guys are slow, like a bunch of girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.32,1:32:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我是梅托斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is Mattox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.48,1:32:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,丹尼同意了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bennett's on board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.92,1:32:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,也该是时候了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's about time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.60,1:32:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,下令吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Call it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.48,1:32:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,把事情办好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get it done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.92,1:32:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,乐意之至{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.04,1:33:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 墨菲女士 - 你可以来我家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Mrs. Murphy... - You can come here as much as you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.32,1:33:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以威胁我告我 拿走我的房子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can threaten me. You can sue me. You can take my home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.68,1:33:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不会罢手 你懂吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I am not gonna stop till I see my husband. Do you understand that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.88,1:33:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,赛勒斯先生想见你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Sellars would very much like to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.16,1:33:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is Alex okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.92,1:33:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他有重要讯息告知 你要来吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has important information to share with you. Will you accompany me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.72,1:33:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}David.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.60,1:33:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要出门 去拿外套{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We gotta go. Can you grab your coat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.20,1:33:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.28,1:33:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我正要坐电梯下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm in the elevator, on my way down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.40,1:33:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我要进实验室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need access to the lab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.04,1:33:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 他们还在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's insane. They're still here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.72,1:33:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你去引开他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Distract them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.52,1:33:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.88,1:33:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.00,1:33:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有个女的歇斯底里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's a lady in here going hysterical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.24,1:33:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,她把门锁上不让我们进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She will not let us in. She's got the codes for the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.20,1:33:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我重复 她不让我们进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I repeat, she will not let us in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.96,1:33:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,小姐 你必须让我们进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady, you need to let us in there now. We have to get in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.32,1:33:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你听不懂我说的话吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you not understanding what I'm saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.92,1:33:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,要是有人死掉你要负责吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you wanna be responsible for the deaths of everyone in this building?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.04,1:33:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,站住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.60,1:33:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,别开枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.80,1:34:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Step outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.64,1:34:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,解除传输器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unlock the transmitter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.68,1:34:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,传输器解除{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Transmitter unlocked!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.16,1:34:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,请墨菲女士进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Send in Mrs. Murphy, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.12,1:34:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right away, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.76,1:34:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,叫醒他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wake him up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.40,1:34:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex! Alex!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.92,1:34:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 我是诺顿博士 快醒来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex, it's Dr. Norton, you have to wake up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.16,1:34:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 听得见吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex, can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.92,1:34:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人要来杀我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These men are here to kill us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.76,1:34:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要来杀我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're here to kill us, for chrissakes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.08,1:34:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,墨菲女士 昨天晚上…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mrs. Murphy, last night,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.88,1:34:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯的精神崩溃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex had a psychotic break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.96,1:34:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他杀了一名同事 然后痉挛发作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He killed an unarmed colleague and later suffered a seizure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.40,1:34:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们尽力了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We did everything,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.00,1:34:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经尽全力还是救不了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}everything, we could, but the doctors couldn't save him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.36,1:35:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 墨菲女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very sorry, Mrs. Murphy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.68,1:35:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很快就会发布消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're going to be making the announcement shortly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.72,1:35:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你把我关掉 她差点就认罪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You shut me down. I was about to get a confession.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.80,1:35:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是梅托斯关掉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mattox shut you down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.80,1:35:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,传输器拔掉就不会再发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've removed your transmitter so he won't do it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.08,1:35:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,赛勒斯不想让你醒来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sellars can't afford to wake you up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.28,1:35:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他派这些人来拔插头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He sent these guys to pull the plug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.88,1:35:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他要你死 艾力克斯 你了解吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He wants you dead, Alex. Do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.56,1:35:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么我们能做的请尽管开口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sorry. If there's anything we can do for you and David, we'll do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.96,1:35:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我不要你的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want nothing from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.04,1:35:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我了解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.92,1:35:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你滚开我们的生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You stay out of our lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.64,1:35:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你和你的公司都是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You and your company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.16,1:35:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你希望这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If that's what you think is best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.00,1:35:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's one more thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.52,1:35:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这对大家都好 尤其是大卫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think it would be to the benefit of everyone, especially David{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.44,1:35:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,就是不要公开这件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if we kept this matter private.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.92,1:35:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不想破坏艾力克斯的形象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We don't wanna damage Alex's legacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.12,1:35:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex! Alex!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.32,1:35:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以解决这个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can fix this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.04,1:35:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你骗我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You lied to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.60,1:35:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你骗我老婆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You lied to my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.92,1:36:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你替那些想杀我的人工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're working for the people that are trying to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.64,1:36:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,博士 你还要我相信你？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You want me to trust you, Doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.96,1:36:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 我可以去找媒体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex, I can go to the press!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.44,1:36:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 我可以告诉他们真相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex, I can tell them the whole story!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.32,1:36:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.32,1:36:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 拜托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Listen to me, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.24,1:36:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex! Alex!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.16,1:36:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.60,1:36:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,行动照旧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Keep all our systems at green light,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.04,1:36:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我接赛勒斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and for chrissakes, get Sellars on the phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.20,1:36:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,收到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Roger that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.28,1:36:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Damn, damn, damn, damn, damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.60,1:36:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这座城市{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look at this city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.00,1:36:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,多么美丽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.56,1:36:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这城市变得多么和平{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's become so peaceful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.04,1:36:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wish{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.36,1:37:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我能为底特律带来好消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had some good news for Detroit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.12,1:37:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,但不幸的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have very sad news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.04,1:37:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管我们全力抢救{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Despite our best efforts to save him,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.00,1:37:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯墨菲仍在几小时前去世{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex Murphy passed away just hours ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.88,1:37:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯墨菲是…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex Murphy was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.24,1:37:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,赛勒斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Sellars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.88,1:37:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 梅托斯打来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What is it? - Mattox just called.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.04,1:37:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,请跟我们离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We need you to come with us now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.16,1:37:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,女士 请往另一边走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ma'am, I need you to turn around and go the other way, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.08,1:37:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说什么？- 发生紧急状况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What are you talking about? - We have a security situation here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.16,1:37:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,请往另一边走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need you to turn around and go the other way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.68,1:37:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要搭外面那台车…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir, there's a car outside that's supposed to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.64,1:37:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那里封锁了 现在快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That area is locked down. Now go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.36,1:37:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 发生什么事？- 我说快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What's happening? - I said go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.36,1:37:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我要和赛勒斯先生说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wanna talk to Mr. Sellars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.28,1:37:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,赛勒斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Sellars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.52,1:37:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 直升机还要多久？- 大概10分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- How close is that helicopter? - About 10 minutes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.32,1:38:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 什么事？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Excuse me. - Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.76,1:38:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我要找杰克路易斯警官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need to speak with Sergeant Jack Lewis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.24,1:38:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是紧急事件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's an emergency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.64,1:38:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,稍待 赛勒斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stand by. Mr. Sellars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.72,1:38:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱拉墨菲要求见你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apparently there's a Clara Murphy in the lobby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.60,1:38:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,要是她看见他 计划就泡汤了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Raymond, if she sees him, we are dead in the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.08,1:38:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你要怎么做？- 带墨菲女士上来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What do you wanna do? - Bring Mrs. Murphy up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.60,1:38:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.60,1:38:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,诺顿说他们大楼使用机器人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Norton said they may be using drones for protection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.56,1:38:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,所以不管做什么 千万别拔枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So whatever you do, do not draw your weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.76,1:38:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,没拿武器就不会被杀 清楚吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They won't shoot if we're unarmed. Clear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.48,1:38:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 清楚 - 清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Clear. - Clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.88,1:38:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,站住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold it right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.24,1:38:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不要动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.06,1:38:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这是私人产业 你无权进入{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is private property. You are not authorized to be here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.28,1:39:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我是你们 我会把枪放下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd put those guns down now if I were you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.76,1:39:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放下武器 - 好 我们让开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Stand down. - All right, man, we're good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.92,1:39:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,开下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Head to the lower level.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.88,1:39:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,停车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold up, hold up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.00,1:39:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,撞开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ram it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.48,1:40:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gun it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.24,1:41:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go. go, go! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.80,1:41:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 快跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex, run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.12,1:41:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,欧姆尼警卫 放下武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Omnicorp Security! Drop your weapons!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.32,1:41:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,放下武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Drop your weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.40,1:41:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,举起双手 没有人会受伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Keep your hands above your head and no one will be harmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.48,1:41:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么事？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.68,1:41:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,墨菲女士 你听清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mrs. Murphy, I want you to listen to me carefully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.12,1:41:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯的有机部分已经死掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The organic part of your husband Alex is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.68,1:41:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,但机器部分功能失常{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The robotic part of him is malfunctioning,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.88,1:41:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他在大开杀戒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and he's shooting up the building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.08,1:41:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们必须带你们离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So we've gotta get you and your son out of here right away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.04,1:41:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我接个电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I gotta take this call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.88,1:41:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他离开大厅往上走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He just left the lobby and he's headed our way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.52,1:42:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,收到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Roger that, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.48,1:42:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别开枪 他是我的 - 知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Don't shoot. My robot. You just flank. - Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.72,1:42:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,锡人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tin Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.72,1:42:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,锡人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tin Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.96,1:42:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,锡人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tin Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.80,1:42:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,它在这{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, there it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.64,1:42:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你看来好惨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You look like crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.64,1:42:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.96,1:42:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不能开枪？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can't shoot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.96,1:42:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.80,1:42:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你在想什么？这不符程序{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What were you thinking? This isn't a drill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.96,1:42:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你是机器人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're a robot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.20,1:42:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我是红色资产 我自己写的程式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm a red asset. Wrote that myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.84,1:42:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.56,1:42:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊 尽管开枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on, Tin Man, just pull the trigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.56,1:42:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,快啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pull it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.36,1:42:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.00,1:42:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.24,1:42:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.84,1:42:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.28,1:42:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 跑吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There you go. Run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.56,1:42:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Run. Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.08,1:42:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,哇噢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whoo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.60,1:42:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,很痛 对吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stings like a bitch, don't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.88,1:42:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,算你幸运 枪没设定在致命模式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Aren't you lucky I didn't have my gun set to "kill"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.44,1:42:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,听着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.20,1:43:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是私人恩怨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This isn't personal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.84,1:43:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,也许有一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, maybe a little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.36,1:43:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我要让你解脱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm gonna put you out of your misery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.92,1:43:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,直升机来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Helicopter's approaching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.44,1:43:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,赛勒斯先生先上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Sellars boards first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.80,1:43:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不 墨菲女士你们先上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no, no. Mrs. Murphy, you and your son can get on first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.16,1:43:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,警官受伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Officer down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.56,1:43:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,欧姆尼大楼的…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mechanical room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.76,1:43:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,机械室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Omnicorp Building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.52,1:43:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,收到 救援马上到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Roger that. EMS on the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.00,1:43:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会有事 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're gonna be okay, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.68,1:43:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没有生命危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's nonfatal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.00,1:43:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,快去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.80,1:43:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,直升机即将降落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Omni-LZ Helo-1 on approach to deck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.36,1:43:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.28,1:43:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他有枪 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- He's got a gun! - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.56,1:43:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,快离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pull up! Pull up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.52,1:44:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他搞什么？- 抱歉 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What the hell is he doing? - Sorry, sir. I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.36,1:44:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.52,1:44:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,爸？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.96,1:44:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱拉 大卫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Clara, David.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.36,1:44:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,哇噢 哇噢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.64,1:44:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.72,1:44:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们走开 - 艾力克斯 把枪放下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Get out of the way. - Alex, put down the gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.76,1:44:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱拉 带大卫离开这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Clara, take David and get out of the way now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.72,1:44:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,雷蒙赛勒斯 我要逮捕你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Raymond Sellars, you're under arrest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.20,1:44:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,罪名是你企图谋杀警察{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for the attempted murder of a police officer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.64,1:44:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你要逮捕我？好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you here to cuff me? All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.96,1:44:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊 来抓我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go 'head, cuff me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.60,1:44:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 程式不是那样设定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can't. You're not programmed that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.28,1:44:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你违背程式 系统会当掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you go against the program, the entire system shuts down, so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.88,1:44:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你没拘捕令 我们可以不追究…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You don't even have a warrant. We'll overlook this little...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.12,1:44:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,趴在地上 手放背后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get down on the ground and put your hands behind your back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.36,1:44:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我只负责行销{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm just from marketing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.52,1:44:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在 - 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Now! - Okay, yep, yep, yep. Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.04,1:44:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 我们必须合作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex, we need to work together here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.36,1:45:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,有我的技术你才能活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because I'm the only one with the technology to keep you alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.60,1:45:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不管死活 我都要逮捕你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dead or alive, you're coming with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.36,1:45:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.52,1:45:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,给我枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.20,1:45:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯 老实说 我不想伤害你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex, honestly, I mean you no harm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.48,1:45:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,若我要你死你早就死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I wanted to, I could have killed you a long time ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.96,1:45:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,只要轰掉你的脑袋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I just aim this right at your head and blow it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.92,1:45:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,赛勒斯 拜托 不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sellars, please! Don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.92,1:45:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,若我高兴 我也可以瞄准你家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean, if I wanted to, I could just aim this at your little family{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.80,1:45:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以干掉他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I could just kill them too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.48,1:45:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,而你根本无能为力 因为现实是…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And really, there's nothing you could do about it because, let's face it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.88,1:45:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你是机器人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you're a robot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.84,1:45:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你了解吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you understand that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.56,1:45:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.72,1:45:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.08,1:45:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.92,1:46:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.64,1:46:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.16,1:46:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything's gonna be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.12,1:46:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything's gonna be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.24,1:47:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得如何？艾力克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How you feeling, Alex?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.92,1:47:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.84,1:47:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.32,1:48:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,目前欧姆尼的母公司 尚未做出任何回应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's still no word from Omnicorp parent company, OCP.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.48,1:48:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,政府表示正在重建艾力克斯墨菲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And although the government says they are rebuilding Alex Murphy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.32,1:48:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,但情况还是众说纷纭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}rumors continue to swirl about his condition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.12,1:48:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我们取得独家手机拍摄画面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But we have obtained exclusive video taken by cell phone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.76,1:48:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,显示艾力克斯墨菲可能很快…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that shows the people of Detroit may have Alex Murphy back on the streets{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.44,1:48:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,就会回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}sooner than they think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.04,1:48:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不过不幸的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The real tragedy here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.64,1:48:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,总统决定维持崔佛斯法案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is that our president chose to uphold the Dreyfus Act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.80,1:48:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为他受到偏颇的媒体…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, I have no doubt he was manipulated by our biased media{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.64,1:48:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,和告密者丹尼诺顿的影响{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and by whistle-blower Dennett Norton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.20,1:49:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道的比想像中的少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I acknowledge we know less than we thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.96,1:49:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信我的研究计划没有错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I do believe my research program is sound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.44,1:49:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但我应用它的方式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What I did with it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.20,1:49:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.32,1:49:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这个天杀的混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The fact that this mother...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.44,1:49:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,没被关进联邦监狱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is not serving time in some federal penitentiary{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.76,1:49:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,根本就是天大的错误{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is a huge, hot, heaping pile of horse...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.52,1:49:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,有些观众可能认为这样想太危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now I know some of you may think that this kind of thinking is dangerous{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.00,1:49:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,认为这些机器违反公民自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and these machines violate your civil liberties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.16,1:49:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,有人甚至觉得在海外使用机器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Some of you even believe that the use of these drones overseas{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.36,1:49:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们成为侵略别国的美帝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}makes us the same kind of bullying imperialists{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.12,1:49:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们祖先逃离的那种国家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that our forefathers were trying to escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.32,1:49:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,对这些人 我要说…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To you, I say...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.96,1:49:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,停止抱怨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop whining!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.16,1:49:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,美国现在是…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}America is now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.88,1:49:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,而且永远都会是…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and always will be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.28,1:50:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,地球上最伟大的国家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the greatest country on the face of the Earth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.24,1:50:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我是派特诺维克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm Pat Novak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.28,1:50:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good night.{\r}
